  "$comment": "THE PILGRIM ROAD, and the widest table on the mountain on purpose. The Ascent is the region walked backwards -- oak and river at the bottom, rock in the middle, snow on top -- so this map's table is the SOUTH-WEST one last time: the beast, verdant and stone Kin the player met on Routes 1 to 4, grown up. Eleven slots, eight types, nothing over twelve per cent.\n\nMEASURED. Levels are 41-45 against a team-raising player who arrives from the climax at about 46-47. Craglide and Galecrest carry the top of the band; Galecrest at four per cent is the first of the four best non-starter Kin in the game that this act puts within reach, and every one of the other three is further up.",
